     PaneBox[
      StyleBox["\<\"Figure 8. The six warp-drive metric families side by \
side.  All panels are slices through the x-y plane.  Top row: Alcubierre's \
energy density, Nat\[AAcute]rio's shift-derivative proxy (no \
expansion/contraction regions, just a wall), Van Den Broeck's pocket factor.  \
Bottom row: White's toroidal shape, the Bobrick\[Dash]Martire shell function \
(a positive-energy double-shell at R_inner = 1, R_outer = 2), and Lentz's \
soliton intensity profile.\"\>",
